      "content": "I mean, I hear you, but that feels like a hail mary. Reaching out to experts and hunting through preprints is way slower and less systematic than the direct API access we have now. From a management perspective, it's looking like it's actually more efficient to just pause the deep synthesis phase of this project until we secure new funding. If we can't do the work properly, there's really no point in running the high-level research agent at all.",
